---
import { BRAND, NAV_LINKS } from '../lib/constants';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-navy-950 text-slate-400 border-t border-navy-800 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10">
      
      <!-- Corporate Identity & Brand Statement -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-md bg-navy-900 border border-gold-400/30 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 font-serif font-bold text-sm tracking-wider">
            I&amp;G
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-serif font-bold text-white tracking-wider uppercase">{BRAND.name}</h3>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-gold-400 font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em]">{BRAND.category}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Lini bisnis pemasaran dan penasihat properti terkurasi di bawah naungan brand <strong>{BRAND.parentBrand}</strong>. Menghubungkan pengembang properti, pemilik aset, investor, dan pembeli melalui layanan pemasaran yang profesional dan transparan.
        </p>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 pt-1">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-navy-900 border border-navy-800 text-gold-400/90 font-mono text-[11px]">
            {BRAND.tagline}
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-white tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 border-b border-navy-800 pb-2">
          Navigasi Institusional
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5">
          {NAV_LINKS.map((link) => (
            <li>
              <a href={link.href} class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors text-xs flex items-center">
                <span class="mr-1.5 text-gold-500/60">›</span> {link.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
          <li>
            <a href="/disclaimer" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors text-xs flex items-center">
              <span class="mr-1.5 text-gold-500/60">›</span> Disclaimer Listing
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Focus Market Areas -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-white tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 border-b border-navy-800 pb-2">
          Koridor Fokus Pemasaran
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-gold-400 mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
            <span><strong>Kota Bekasi:</strong> Summarecon, Medan Satria, Harapan Indah, Rawalumbu, Kemang Pratama</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-gold-400 mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
            <span><strong>Kabupaten Bekasi:</strong> Cikarang Selatan, Cikarang Pusat, Deltamas, Lippo Cikarang</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-gold-400 mr-2 font-bold">•</span>
            <span><strong>Koridor Tol Cikampek:</strong> Grand Wisata Tambun, Cibitung, Tambun Selatan</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Official Contact & Admin Access -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-white tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 border-b border-navy-800 pb-2">
          Saluran Komunikasi
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
          Konsultasi portofolio properti, penjadwalan survey lokasi, atau eksplorasi kemitraan pengembang & pemilik aset:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <p class="flex items-center text-slate-300">
            <span class="text-gold-400 mr-2 font-semibold">WhatsApp:</span> {BRAND.phone}
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center text-slate-300">
            <span class="text-gold-400 mr-2 font-semibold">Email:</span> {BRAND.email}
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed pt-1">
            {BRAND.address}
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="/admin/login"
            class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 hover:text-gold-400/80 transition-colors inline-flex items-center"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
            </svg>
            Portal Manajemen Tim Advisory (Internal)
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Legal Disclaimer Notice -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-navy-900/80 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500 bg-navy-900/30 p-4 rounded-lg">
      <p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-slate-400">Pernyataan Transparansi & Kepatuhan Legalitas:</p>
      <p>
        {BRAND.name} beroperasi sebagai lini bisnis pemasaran dan penasihat properti (Property Marketing & Advisory) di bawah kepemilikan brand {BRAND.parentBrand}, dan bukan pengembang properti. Seluruh informasi harga, simulasi angsuran, promosi developer, dan ketersediaan stok fisik unit bersifat indikatif dan wajib dikonfirmasi ulang saat penjadwalan survey atau perikatan resmi. Gambar berlabel <span class="text-gold-400 font-semibold">[DEMO]</span> adalah representasi portofolio arsitektural.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright and Policies -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-navy-900 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-3 sm:space-y-0">
      <p>© {currentYear} {BRAND.name}. Hak Cipta Dilindungi Undang-Undang.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-6">
        <a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Kebijakan Privasi</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Syarat & Ketentuan</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Disclaimer</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
